WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.084 --> 00:00:01.564
Hello up there!

2
00:00:01.704 --> 00:00:03.485
[s@Hello up there!

3
00:00:03.565 --> 00:00:04.285
Who are you?

4
00:00:04.306 --> 00:00:06.206
I'm a green iguana.

5
00:00:06.226 --> 00:00:13.830
Iguanas are a type of lizard.

6
00:00:31.848 --> 00:00:32.969
Where do you live?

7
00:00:34.950 --> 00:00:38.572
We live in warm places like Central America.

8
00:00:40.133 --> 00:00:42.114
The rain forest is our home.

9
00:00:45.096 --> 00:00:46.537
I like your spines.

10
00:00:48.458 --> 00:00:50.880
Our spines protect us from enemies.

11
00:00:52.400 --> 00:00:54.322
We have strong tails too.

12
00:00:55.843 --> 00:00:57.924
We use them to fight enemies.

13
00:01:00.968 --> 00:01:02.909
Your tail is very long.

14
00:01:04.629 --> 00:01:07.370
Sometimes we break off our tails.

15
00:01:08.970 --> 00:01:10.851
This helps us escape danger.

16
00:01:12.311 --> 00:01:14.752
Later we grow new tails.

17
00:01:18.313 --> 00:01:19.733
Do you like to climb?

18
00:01:21.494 --> 00:01:24.515
Yes! We use our claws to climb.

19
00:01:26.775 --> 00:01:28.936
We spend lots of time in trees.

20
00:01:32.124 --> 00:01:33.205
What do you eat?

21
00:01:35.127 --> 00:01:38.229
We eat leaves, fruit, and flowers.

22
00:01:39.670 --> 00:01:41.552
We have sharp teeth for chewing.

23
00:01:46.296 --> 00:01:47.797
Do you go in the water?

24
00:01:49.458 --> 00:01:52.440
Sometimes we hide from enemies in the water.

25
00:01:54.302 --> 00:01:57.665
We can stay underwater for a long time.

26
00:01:57.685 --> 00:02:02.963
Uh-oh! I hear a hawk.

27
00:02:03.925 --> 00:02:05.227
It's time for a swim.

28
00:02:07.192 --> 00:02:07.733
Good-bye,
